  "label": "User projected onto the Black man as embodying peace and love",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the Black man (Black_man) as the embodiment of the message 'peace is love'. The user sees themselves as aligned with or identifying with the figure's gesture and presence, interpreting him as a symbol of peace and love. This projection is facilitated by the text overlay 'peace is love' which is mapped onto his visual presence (mapping_1).",
